      <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:540px;margin:0 0 28px;">Your entrance is the first thing anybody sees when they pull up to your place. We build ranch entrances around Waco and Central Texas that look sharp, swing true, and hold up for decades.</p>
